# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is committed.
# Neither key is ever written into web/ or data/ — fetchers read them at run time only.

# Google Places API (New) — NOT the legacy "Places API". GCP project + billing
# account required even though the bill is $0. Opening-hours fields bill under
# the Enterprise SKU: 1,000 free calls/month, ~35 refreshes at 28 venues.
# Restrict the key to Places API (New) and set a daily quota cap.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# SerpApi — Google Maps engine, for the Popular Times histogram.
# Free tier 250 searches/month, throttled to 50/hour. This is the binding
# constraint on refresh frequency: ~8 refreshes/month at 28 venues.
SERPAPI_KEY=

# Step-by-step setup for both: see "Getting the two API keys" in README.md.